OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny rain
OL,6,Fsoon clearing away this evening. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry
OL,8,Facross all parts with lengthy clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Chilly across Deeside.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,12,Fwith some good spells of sunshine.
OL,13,FHigh cloud spilling northeast later.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWindy
OL,16,Fwith patchy rain spreading north later
OL,17,Fon Tuesday. Early rain on Wednesday
OL,18,Fthen bright with the odd shower.
OL,19,FMainly dry and bright on Thursday.
